{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11110110","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11110110","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1111011001:1":{"text":"...He's from the Quicksand Claws?!","source_cn":"……流沙之爪？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F2B3AC3D369D43B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111011002:1":{"text":"Relax, alright? He cost me a pretty penny.","source_cn":"都说了别太冲动。他是我花大价钱收买的线人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB9B50D77098AAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111011003:1":{"text":"I agreed to meet you because of the promise of gold. I never guaranteed any info.","source_cn":"我是拿那些闪闪发亮的金币没办法，才答应和你见一面，没答...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC9AA0A4A1E4A974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111011004:1":{"text":"The longer I stick around, the higher the chance I get caught. What's in it for me?","source_cn":"在这里待得越久，我暴露的风险越高。风险全是我一个人背，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AC28748760C7FB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111011005:1":{"text":"How about now?","source_cn":"再加上这些，足够让你面对风险了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10733237D0A8E1EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111011006:1":{"text":"That's mighty generous of you! Must've taken you a good year to earn all this.","source_cn":"噢哟，阔绰！这些都够你一年挣的赏金了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC70E67D15BCAB8A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111011007:1":{"text":"Cut the crap! Why is he here? I could use him as a punching bag.","source_cn":"少跟他废话。你让这家伙来这里做什么？不是让我揍来解气的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF59D94747E2B224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111011008:1":{"text":"Easy, now. You wanna help your people or not?","source_cn":"冷静，你还想不想知道族人的消息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6180AA2BCD720382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111011009:1":{"text":"...Ugh!","source_cn":"……啐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF02C094B48CED86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111011010:1":{"text":"Then we play by my rules. One bag of gold for one question.","source_cn":"那就按照我的规矩，一个问题，一袋金币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E58F612CBE94344","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111011011:1":{"text":"Let me make it clear. I'm not giving away the location of our main camp or Ferranc's plans. He treats his men no better than those prisoners. I'm not ready to die yet.","source_cn":"事先声明，要我直接说出大本营所在地或者弗兰克的计划，没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F7C267D36883D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111011012:1":{"text":"If that's your question, go ahead, but don't expect an answer. The gold's still mine. You don't like it, I'm out.","source_cn":"你们可以问，我不会回答。钱照付。不同意的话就当我今天没来过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2787865F8DB158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1111011012":{"text":"If that's your question, go ahead, but don't expect an answer. The gold's still mine. You don't like it, I'm out.","source_cn":"你们可以问，我不会回答。钱照付。不同意的话就当我今天没来过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2787865F8DB158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111011013:1":{"text":"Unfortunately, before I met Satrana, I had zero clue where the Quicksand Claws were. I paid to bring him here, so we better get something out of it.","source_cn":"没办法……遇见萨忒娜小姑娘之前，没有其他方式可以知道流...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x670321A5602F8EAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111011014:1":{"text":"Here's your bag of gold. First question: How's Ferranc holding up? Don't need to know his exact whereabouts.","source_cn":"拿着你的钱。第一个问题，弗兰克的近况？我不需要知道他在哪里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC5CABE565A59C26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111011015:1":{"text":"After hearing rumors about the treasure, he colluded with some men and learned to formulate complex robbery plans. We've been busy since. The leisure days are long gone.","source_cn":"哼，听说宝藏传闻后，他和一些人类勾结上，学会了制定复杂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ECEEAF009606EAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111011016:1":{"text":"His cruelty and arrogance haven't changed a bit. That's all I can say.","source_cn":"他和你知道的一样，依旧残忍又自大。其他的，我不能说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB4F01B2FEC099B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111011017:1":{"text":"My clansmen, some young Maulers, where have you taken them?","source_cn":"我的族人，一些年轻的蛮血，被你们抓到哪里去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x560F6526B391F5FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111011018:1":{"text":"Money first.","source_cn":"钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10D0AAFE105686DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111011019:1":{"text":"...Tsk!","source_cn":"……啧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC63923B7F6CEB1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1111011019":{"text":"...Tsk!","source_cn":"……啧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC63923B7F6CEB1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1111011021:1":{"text":"Good.","source_cn":"不错，算识相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90AD88753F00DAEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111011022:1":{"text":"All our prisoners must go through a \"training program\" at the main camp first. Ferranc will then select outstanding laborers to work at other sites.","source_cn":"绑来的俘虏会先在大本营接受“训练”，等能成为优秀的劳工...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52FB80E112DE6C02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1111011023:1":{"text":"I can't say for sure who your clanspeople are. But if they got nabbed recently, odds are they're at the main camp.","source_cn":"我不知道你说的族人是谁，但如果是最近被抓的，那应该还在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x680244F816E7C723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1111011024:1":{"text":"If they're lucky, they might still be kicking. If not... well, who knows what fate has in store for them.","source_cn":"如果运气好，他们就还活着。要是运气不好……谁也说不准。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11FE6112EFA569E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1111011025:1":{"text":"Don't sweat it, buddy. You've got quite the fiery spirit. Luck's gotta be on your side.","source_cn":"别担心，小兄弟，你脾气这么坏，运气肯定不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF75DB3FFD8A220C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111011026:1":{"text":"...You're not making any sense.","source_cn":"……什么歪理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7FF86F1D449AEBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1111011027:1":{"text":"Happy? Go on, then. Ask more questions. More money for me.","source_cn":"满意了吗？继续继续，再多给我点赚钱的机会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB38E039CC09CAC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1111011028:1":{"text":"Let's go. We've already wasted too much time on this bastard.","source_cn":"走。这种人，和他多说一句话都脏了我的嘴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F54EC5260AE547C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1111011029:1":{"text":"Hey—! Friendly advice, folks. If you're thinking of springing your people, Ferranc'll make sure you'll regret it!","source_cn":"喂——喂！我可警告一句，要是去劫人，弗兰克不会放过你们的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25C89F2348CB583E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1111011030:1":{"text":"Perfect. My bullet has been waiting.","source_cn":"哈，那正好，我的子弹等他很久了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A0D018C6DA6D30E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:0:1":{"text":"Here's the gold. Now, spill.","source_cn":"（付钱）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2EDF11D5E68A8EAF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Here's the gold. Now, spill.","female":"Here's the gold. Now, spill.","variant_male_record_index":"63890","variant_female_record_index":"63891","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1111011020:0":{"text":"Take it. I came prepared.","source_cn":"拿去，为今天这个机会，我做足了准备。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x917F1ACBE578630A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:1:2":{"text":"Walker, can you cover this?","source_cn":"（让瓦尔克付钱）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1FFF5534216940A6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Walker, can you cover this?","female":"Walker, can you cover this?","variant_male_record_index":"63892","variant_female_record_index":"63893","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"That's robbery!","source_cn":"真黑啊，凭什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xED43C7CFA7515AE2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's robbery!","female":"That's robbery!","variant_male_record_index":"63884","variant_female_record_index":"63885","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"Can we really trust this guy?","source_cn":"我们一定要从他嘴里打听情报？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD2A0293D1415F0D7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Can we really trust this guy?","female":"Can we really trust this guy?","variant_male_record_index":"63886","variant_female_record_index":"63887","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:2:3":{"text":"Well, I'm never short on gold.","source_cn":"幸好，我最不缺的就是钱","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x273990982155442A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Well, I'm never short on gold.","female":"Well, I'm never short on gold.","variant_male_record_index":"63888","variant_female_record_index":"63889","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"Walker","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:线人猞足":{"text":"Informant Talon","source":"线人猞足","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":38,"localized_text_count":37,"speaker_count":3}}